# External Plugins Fixture — runnable .http examples
#
# This is the fabricated external plugin used by the automated E2E tests. It
# serves the external-plugin wire contract on loopback only. Start it with:
#   dotnet ControlPlane.ExternalPlugins.Fixture.dll --urls http://127.0.0.1:0 --mode normal
#
# Placeholders only: use localhost or example.invalid. Never commit a real
# hostname, address, or credential.

@FIXTURE = http://example.invalid:5099

###
# Discovery payload the bridge reads at startup.

GET {{FIXTURE}}/capabilities
Accept: application/json

###
# Read the remote health status provider.

GET {{FIXTURE}}/status/health?projectId=placeholder
Accept: application/json

###
# Validate the remote ping operation.

POST {{FIXTURE}}/operations/ping/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "placeholder",
  "input": {}
}

###
# Execute the remote ping operation.

POST {{FIXTURE}}/operations/ping/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "placeholder",
  "input": {}
}
